<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY TO AUCTION 2YR BOND OF HUF 35BLN ON JAN 30.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY TO AUCTION 2YR BOND OF HUF 35BLN ON JAN 30.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will auction 35 billion</p>
<p>forints worth of the two-year government bonds of 1999/E series</p>
<p>on January 30, the Government Debt Management Agency said on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p> Date of issue		 9 January 1997</p>
<p> Date of maturity	   12 January 1999</p>
<p> Bills on offer	     35,000 million forints</p>
<p> Minimum net price	  99.08 pct</p>
<p> Previous average price   99.84 pct</p>
<p>NOTE -  The bond bears a fixed interest of 19.50 percent</p>
<p>to be paid twice yearly, on January 12 and July 12.</p>
<p>    Interest payment     Date			Percent</p>
<p>				 12 July 1997	    9.83</p>
<p>				 12 January 1998	 9.83</p>
<p>				 12 July 1998	    9.67</p>
<p>				 12 January 1999	 9.83</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
